Z||000005||fiero56||10-03-2000||09:14 PM||||I have an original sunroof sunshade bag and original sunroof sunshade. Bought my Formula from original owner, and when Pontiac handed him the bag and cover, he just threw them in a closet and never touched them again until I bought the car from him. Even the velcro dots are unused. I have 'preserved' the bag and shade by sticking them far back in a closet, and haven't really touched them since. There is a salvage yard around here with one or two sunshade bags, but they are in terrible condition.||||reg||10
